{"version":1,"content":"<p>卡普空確認其Capcom ID服務發生重大安全漏洞，導致全球超過1170萬個賬户的相關信息泄露。該公司表示，已採取緊急措施阻止未經授權的訪問，目前仍在對此次事件的全面影響進行調查。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1583472.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T05:23:45.112500+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":95,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T05:02:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T05:18:01.782982+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T05:18:01.782982+00:00","content_hash":"a45b01b04f6d3d7f5c1fe11ee153aecce7a7feeceb2c92332c4692d9b71fe2fd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}